1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
 A Hong Kong university just open sourced an entire AI hedge fund and it runs on your laptop

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,400
 for free.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,540
 It's called Vibe Trading and this is insane.

4
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:11,700
 You type what you want in plain English and a whole team of AI agents goes to work.

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,680
 One researches, one builds the strategy, one runs the backtest, another reviews the risk.

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,360
 A real trading desk in your terminal.

7
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:22,340
 It pulls live data from 18 sources across stocks, crypto and forex, and stress tests

8
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,940
 every strategy with Monte Carlo before you risk a single dollar.

9
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:29,600
 And the part nobody's talking about, upload your real broker history and it tells you

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,100
 exactly which of your own habits are bleeding you money.

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,740
 More than 400 pre-built quant strategies, 15,000 developers already on it.

12
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,760
 Open source and free.

